    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith & Butler Estates are delighted to present this beautifully maintained second-floor, two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment. Presented in excellent condition throughout and ready for immediate occupation, the property benefits from a B-rated BER, offering both comfort and energy efficiency.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with a welcoming entrance hallway leading into the bright open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, providing an ideal space for both relaxing and entertaining. A door from the living area opens onto a private balcony overlooking the communal grounds to the front of the development. The fully fitted kitchen offers ample wall and floor storage together with generous workspace, designed for practicality and everyday convenience. The accommodation is completed by two generously sized double bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, a main bathroom and a spacious en-suite serving the primary bedroom.\r\n\r\nSaint Canice’s Square is a mature and popular residential development, conveniently located close to Finglas Village and a wide range of local amenities. The area benefits from an excellent selection of shops, schools, cafés, parks and leisure facilities, all within easy reach. Charlestown Shopping Centre is also nearby, providing further retail and everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, with regular bus routes providing access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The M50 and M1 motorway networks are easily accessible, while Dublin Airport is also within a convenient distance, making the location well connected for both local and wider travel.\r\n\r\nAnnual Service Charge: Approx. €2,776.14"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Foyer – 1.24m x 2.78m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, access to storage space and intercom system.\r\n\r\nHallway – 2.87m x 1.05m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 2.15m x 2.99m\r\nWith tiled flooring, tiled splashback around the kitchen counter, ample wall and floor storage units, and integrated appliances including oven, electric hob, extractor fan and fridge/freezer. Plumbed for a washing machine with potential for a dishwasher.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 2.97m x 2.99m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.36m x 3.28m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, double-glazed window overlooking the front communal area and access to the balcony.\r\n\r\nBalcony – 1.02m x 2.18m\r\nWith decked flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom – 3.13m x 2.78m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobe, curtain pole and curtains.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom – 2.52m x 1.63m\r\nWith tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, bathtub, WC and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom – 2.50m x 4.14m\r\nWith laminate wood flooring, built-in wardrobe, curtain pole with curtains and fitted roller blind.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite – 3.23m x 1.33m\r\nGenerously sized en-suite with tiled flooring, walk-in shower with tiled surround, double-glazed window, wall-mounted cabinet with vanity mirror, WC and wash hand basin."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Efficient B-rated BER\r\nDesignated underground parking space\r\nSecond-floor apartment with lift access\r\nSecure gated development\r\nLift access from the apartment level to the underground car park\r\nDouble-glazed windows throughout\r\nConvenient Finglas location with excellent access to local amenities and transport links"
      },
